@startuml status_lifecycle_flow
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 40
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,sans-serif

title Status Lifecycle Flow — PlayerState 重构 (intention #15)

actor "GameCore.play_round()" as GC
participant "CardResolver" as CR
participant "Player.statuses" as PS
database "RoundResult" as RR
actor "Frontend" as FE
database "SessionStore" as SS

== Round N: 状态授予 ==

GC -> CR: resolve(cards_1, cards_2,\n  player_1.statuses,\n  player_2.statuses, ...)
note right of CR
  检查 pre-existing statuses:
  - StatusType.DEFENSE in p1_statuses
  - StatusType.GUARD in p2_statuses
  替换字符串硬编码
end note

CR --> GC: ResolutionResult(\n  statuses_granted_1: [StatusType.DEFENSE],\n  statuses_granted_2: [])

GC -> PS: statuses = [\n  PlayerStatus(DEFENSE, lifetime=1)\n]
note right of PS
  lifetime 由 GameCore 设为 1
  不再维护独立 _status_lifetimes 数组
end note

GC -> RR: RoundResult(statuses_1=[PlayerStatus(DEFENSE, 1)], ...)

GC -> FE: get_state() -> statuses=[{"type":"defense","lifetime":1}]

GC -> SS: save() -> statuses=[{"type":"defense","lifetime":1}]
note right of SS
  不再保存 status_lifetimes_1/2 字段
end note

== Round N+1 开始前: 生存期 Tick ==

GC -> PS: _tick_status_lifetimes()
note right of PS
  遍历每个 PlayerStatus:
  - lifetime -= 1
  - lifetime <= 0 则移除
  不再需要索引对齐
end note

PS --> GC: statuses = [\n  PlayerStatus(DEFENSE, lifetime=0)\n] -> 被移除

== Round N+1: 新一轮 ==

GC -> CR: resolve(..., statuses=[], ...)
note right of CR
  statuses 为空
  不会触发 grant_guard / defense 阻挡
end note

CR --> GC: ResolutionResult(statuses_granted_* = [])

@enduml
